, "chunk_id": "65b41f70-94c1-446a-aed0-54333db73d24", "text": "Don't rotate or distortheillustration.\n\nDon't overlap with text, images or graphics.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon't create close-ups of theillustration.\n\nDon't overlapwith otherillustrations.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMagazine\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPowerPoint\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nNewsletter\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nWebsite"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:a3012042-dc74-4d7a-979f-589e8fe55597", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 18, "token_count": 54, "page_number": 10, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "797d957d-d57e-4c3c-a4b6-fa734b9db55a", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "26b78fb8ba683b459eb5052273693dfcefebd6484faae7d76777f75093414fc2", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "a3012042-dc74-4d7a-979f-589e8fe55597", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMagnifying the issue sodus aseas asmus o siewue o sueny jo slens anowa-uou busn Symptomdepictions Cellularinsight deeperunderstanding.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:e01abe85-de30-4426-8df2-b69064530a10", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 19, "token_count": 123, "page_number": 10, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "6ebfbe11-1bf0-490a-be71-99cb34ea04e8", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "9336b8414e8803510c088f592c8c567c9a816efc83186b84107bff0e0046131b", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "e01abe85-de30-4426-8df2-b69064530a10", "text": "achieve this, we're strategic in our use of color. We primarily use grayscale and White for backgrounds and depictions of humans andanimals.\n\ntypes of diseases or group elements, and create distinctions within the illustrations. This ensures that our illustrations aren't just ssau Focus point pue an leuue uo suooidap uodus, dot ansnxa siopos Aepuoas asn When depicting different parts of the same rganorcellular element, ue differentiation is required. Cellular insights outline for clarity."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:cd96784a-40e2-42e3-aaf0-bb93494f94bd", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 20, "token_count": 41, "page_number": 11, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "e3a0d40b-327c-4bff-98c4-1121d5fbcfab", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "3cf82f3ed2961cea754499c85d833fcd6a3875c13b4bfb1051f33451ff414163", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "cd96784a-40e2-42e3-aaf0-bb93494f94bd", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nAenb layep e busn 'suebio ay buidap iot pasn ae Aenb jo sapeys snoen The specific disease area is highlighted with secondary colors."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:5ec2a1f7-2ba2-4db0-810c-9c689fe59309", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 21, "token_count": 29, "page_number": 11, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "66389088-c0fc-4e1a-8c22-0a098012fbc7", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "199005488cdba05810308cdb2188a8a7c72643268964f5fbf6e4081842f55768", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "5ec2a1f7-2ba2-4db0-810c-9c689fe59309", "text": "designed various format proportions to cater to different requirements.\n\nmedical/technical subjects.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ba20aa10-6654-493d-84d6-e128a994408e", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 22, "token_count": 4, "page_number": 11, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "5f17c305-cbea-45ca-a7a7-6fa643ac6b66", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "e5dc819883d3c4b39a4a3f3054652d05bbceb23ae07f1d5f396b3cb309cce5fb", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "ba20aa10-6654-493d-84d6-e128a994408e", "text": "<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:0e4dd03c-ec76-422c-a4f9-11ed4fa888bc", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 23, "token_count": 43, "page_number": 12, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "fff200d4-4b0f-4958-8856-5f156ecec568", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "a937b00e5d429173891bef6d0b085e432dc655cbae5b3c9a9b9864ed16a5fc85", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "0e4dd03c-ec76-422c-a4f9-11ed4fa888bc", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\na oads  n peun sdo t suesuoai sn Don't rotate or distort the illustration.\n\nDon't overlap with other illustrations or icons.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:2a9c82fa-1a48-43a3-87a1-243e24db0f77", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 24, "token_count": 174, "page_number": 12, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "091e541f-fd80-48ed-be41-c5eedb571dae", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "ad26720941848080f64098e67b587f75bd00abb26914e7edfed0fb56fbb87571", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "2a9c82fa-1a48-43a3-87a1-243e24db0f77", "text": "pue yadap jo saabap uien auo otsuoesnsn am aquaa uoue do uesn ue asn ot lauaum buap uau 'auo pue ubisap ino ot suawala bulahos e buppe pue asuodsan leuoowa aou e busyona rixalduos\n\n'denb aqeua! anbuis e yonou ne - uoeieu pue aouepinb apod pue uoeou! adwis aeys ot suo!asn am\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nD\n\nLow degree of realism Introducing a topic or framing text elements\n\nQuickly sharing information\n\nLevel 01: Standalone\n\nIcons Abstract Quickly sharing information Level03:Technical Technical drawings Higher degree of realism Level 02:Scene Depicting medical topics Informing Emotional storytelling Depicting complex scenes, immersive experiences Medium degree of realism\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ca2cba93-0513-4237-bf4a-b4ae457b4e74", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 25, "token_count": 4, "page_number": 13, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "7be105f3-ae87-4db6-b9e6-9dcf979d9bb3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "e5dc819883d3c4b39a4a3f3054652d05bbceb23ae07f1d5f396b3cb309cce5fb", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "ca2cba93-0513-4237-bf4a-b4ae457b4e74", "text": "<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:82875fc3-9363-45fe-bfc8-0427389bbd14", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 26, "token_count": 33, "page_number": 13, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "c265e7f3-42de-4e3c-98da-081a6758c297", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "f3844282d4659518deaab62f05fe7c2a68c51fecf1ea637b79a18f35a2b4dd24", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "82875fc3-9363-45fe-bfc8-0427389bbd14", "text": "au ot papeoidn aq ueo aue aotea jeoide pue maia obrapun sn suoensn aeano imau le reun aeme aq aseald Brand Hub illustration library."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:77dce036-43ed-4880-a4fb-53af40aba888", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 27, "token_count": 39, "page_number": 13, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "d0dfc512-8794-4a05-afdb-ec03d1e55710", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "0f7e8aca4b1ba8cf5c5faf3744d382e7d24f934c2f1d341984b182d7cc613a6f", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "77dce036-43ed-4880-a4fb-53af40aba888", "text": "style.\n\nRead on for tips and techniques for constructing Standalone illustrations. This will ensure we're all adhering to the same approved\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:0695835c-bb36-4edf-b9ea-8342653c8ace", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 28, "token_count": 80, "page_number": 14, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "4d0187ae-07df-4460-8834-6ba9f35887e4", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "47aca01e7a404f280639d11113dfe2445552315aa203ded0cc7644513b857170", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "0695835c-bb36-4edf-b9ea-8342653c8ace", "text": "Standalone illustrations are designed with a canvas size of 200 x 200 px. The longer side of the illustration must measure precisely 200 px, and the ilustration should be centered within the frame. You can scale the illustration while preserving the same proportions as the original 200 x 200 px artwork.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:02e717a6-a249-47df-ad63-ab1d83aae1e1", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 29, "token_count": 56, "page_number": 14, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "8dd608a3-8ac9-4100-81ca-5a10965a70fa", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "f1b51e357664448f6ea0cb35f67ec2078dc316b20fea30f17181a3f366d6e47a", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "02e717a6-a249-47df-ad63-ab1d83aae1e1", "text": "'sewjue labe o aldoad jo Apog mnt au apnjxa am 'suoensn ano ueap jo jaal pue as iensi suasisuos e ueuie oi Don'tillustrate the fullbody of people or larger animals.\n\nOnly depict the face of larger subjects.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ce00a027-665a-40cf-9563-d75a5d5591d0", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 30, "token_count": 104, "page_number": 14, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "85a4c8ee-9775-4519-9d80-4d3db388e286", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "da838182d90bdff77a6c5fccc77b5c99df6cd1a433fa40be06bec3d0e4755e41", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "ce00a027-665a-40cf-9563-d75a5d5591d0", "text": "d ' o yrpim aos au ias pue peoge xd ox ooe ym ug im aos woune ym sioans penpu aei\n\n'saos au u saenha lo sdunq neneuun ue jo pionap uealo sheadde uome leu au pue roows ae suod sooan eue Strokefeatures The corners and caps of the strokes should always have rounded attributes.\n\nStrokewidth Don't mix stroke widths in an illustration.\n\nThe stroke width remains at 1.5 pt with a consistent width profile.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:fdbee5ef-f00f-4040-9d86-491c8318b6d0", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 31, "token_count": 4, "page_number": 15, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "07fb5b9d-4405-4865-8606-b12081edc1c1", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "e5dc819883d3c4b39a4a3f3054652d05bbceb23ae07f1d5f396b3cb309cce5fb", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "fdbee5ef-f00f-4040-9d86-491c8318b6d0", "text": "<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:b4d51add-9408-46b8-9e22-5a1467f76a19", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 32, "token_count": 65, "page_number": 15, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "741ea0b7-ddcb-4399-a444-9898875e0799", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "99ba13584d777f308b041dc66ca99bb20f4fa10d053ba602dd4e8ab9bb40e8d7", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "b4d51add-9408-46b8-9e22-5a1467f76a19", "text": "ot suoesnlnt au jo t-s uasaida pinoys seaie asaui seaie pa ot dn aney pnous auoepues ay jo sed aos 'suoesnl eu ssooe Aouaisisuos ansua ot pue seaie pa pue sauno uaamaq aouejeq poob e uuiu The filled area must not exceed 15% of the illustration.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:fcc2f2d5-55dc-4f0f-a808-72f2fcd1089d", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 33, "token_count": 47, "page_number": 15, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "728cb0c3-de19-4c29-93d0-23445acdac99", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "f37c849bc0e10368c79873028bf9adccd4a100847e7a1555f8b25f573ee6d0c8", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "fcc2f2d5-55dc-4f0f-a808-72f2fcd1089d", "text": "When suitable for the illustration, employ a 'crossing line' to enhance it. This method involves incorporating an organic line that intersects the artwork, adding dynamism and engagement."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:78ad4562-e37b-4af7-8444-0872880be02b", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 34, "token_count": 90, "page_number": 16, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "0f474544-c29f-4f45-877c-9821b537c4a9", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "c1900618a9eeb4e4c7170bfde67532e9aae34dc89e6de9de7c911fd392e17a9d", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "78ad4562-e37b-4af7-8444-0872880be02b", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\nHuman eye For human eyes, we emphasize detail when rendering the upper eyelid and eyeball. The shape of the upper eyelid may vary based\n\n'suoissaidxa neoe ades ot sn smoe smoaa bupnourae se yns seap peuope auoo sdiay adeys pa laddn a Eyebrows UpperEyelidShape Glasses If a person depicted in the illustration wears glasses, don't draw eyebrows."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:dab03006-c3a5-41be-9564-0a6064ad19f3", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 35, "token_count": 4, "page_number": 17, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "dc255b81-1327-41f9-be2d-8ef5dcd65a73", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "e5dc819883d3c4b39a4a3f3054652d05bbceb23ae07f1d5f396b3cb309cce5fb", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "dab03006-c3a5-41be-9564-0a6064ad19f3", "text": "<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:a4c61646-48ff-43be-bfb6-2a71307451d8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 36, "token_count": 196, "page_number": 17, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "d30f13e6-5c8a-4b12-bf58-ec810ab1028b", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "b786c87fcbe5dd67c5a9d5422bcaa8d7cc19090651d0b8ba2f5973b260b7781f", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "a4c61646-48ff-43be-bfb6-2a71307451d8", "text": "various areas within the illustration, like hands, where they define individual fingers, ensuring enhanced detail.\n\nConsistency is essential in our Scene illustrations, characterized by the use of two consistent stroke widths. Beginning with a 1080 px height artboard, the stroke width is set at 2 pt. While we maintain a handcrafted appearance, it's essential to steer clear of Always ensure vector points are smooth, to deliver a clean, polished final artwork without irregularities in strokes.\n\nBasicstroke The brush stroke adds fine details to hair in both humans and animals. The stroke width is 1 pt, and we use the charcoal pencil available in llustrator. Brushstroke stroke width is 2 pt with a uniform width profile. Corners and caps should consistentlyhaveroundedattributes."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:a9894a91-4f73-4b9b-bc13-60b8f626d0ea", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 37, "token_count": 56, "page_number": 17, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "e8f8ec81-bcf2-42e2-9123-2a2069f79c21", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "02c4139b7196eaa074f0219f0f39c9991b9547c613bc467a8b63beca5a397437", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "a9894a91-4f73-4b9b-bc13-60b8f626d0ea", "text": "'saul aoadsiad yonou pahauoo qns aq pinous suauuoua suoesnllul punoyoeq pue punoaiot snleeds aeao o saul aoadsad asn a without the need for intricate detailing. Fullscene relationships within the illustration.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:943f263f-87a7-4934-b7be-04df8588d544", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 38, "token_count": 79, "page_number": 18, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "81021d5a-a309-46ba-94ff-2cf9828a4b14", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "9e2333f8ff0cb6231cf4bc88fb0225d4b2ae99e7aa666c8cdce363568fa8e239", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "943f263f-87a7-4934-b7be-04df8588d544", "text": "Strategic positioning of objects and subjects in theforeground and background evoking emotions and expressions. This intensifies the emphasis on the subject's allows us to craft a balanced and engaging visual narrative, capturing attention Half-croppedscene feelings,foramoreemotionallyengagingvisual. Close-upscenes"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:b7387625-473f-4b0c-a8a4-3f40dd3892b8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 39, "token_count": 166, "page_number": 18, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "c9067e64-4a53-4e88-b203-82d49ba68f5a", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "52e61de60ce136ca9de09188b4db788a27eaa78aca54746907894dded6cbdffb", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "b7387625-473f-4b0c-a8a4-3f40dd3892b8", "text": "oidap ot pasn aqueo au sau anouoo aooaqueo saul aoadsiad au suoesnl auaos u papaau s xauos ao au of a scene.\n\nforeground. Context The lines can be cut by the scene and framed by the format if the motive remains clear.\n\nMake sure to keep the background reduced in\n\ndetails.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDo's used when the surroundingof a sceneis neededfor more context or necessary The object line approach for nature or architecture in the background can be toconveytheintendedmessage. Environment Objects must not attract too much attentionor contain any symbolism. Objects Objectsintheforeground When objects areforeground, the same stylecriteria are applied as to subjects."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:fbdda57e-83ac-4fd0-b150-b891da85cd25", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 40, "token_count": 19, "page_number": 19, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "0afbd321-6e3a-4eb6-a299-aff696713578", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "d193bc31308052914c8e63ca13795301db66547d84300a1888b87ee21147e230", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "fbdda57e-83ac-4fd0-b150-b891da85cd25", "text": "-Lifeforward\n\nBrand Hub | Boehringer Ingelheim\n\nBrand elements\n\nIllustrations"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:6df11c44-14be-414e-b45d-0dec80687bb0", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 41, "token_count": 58, "page_number": 19, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "e177a21b-44c6-4c8b-8ab0-7d83341e8ae3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "bc7d4a730d6d2abe61f691b057eee3a06add7b28eae935f5d2742e4f0dcc4b6f", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "6df11c44-14be-414e-b45d-0dec80687bb0", "text": "exaggeratebodyparts.\n\nkey.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\ntheillustration.\n\nAbasic structure is the foundation for constructing the body, ensuring the final result maintains a sense of realism while retaining the artistic and stylistic elements of"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:55c32b7d-6a54-41c7-8172-7eae2496dba8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 42, "token_count": 46, "page_number": 19, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "fc979f8a-6976-4995-b59b-26c9a315226d", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "43124ec55ed3d0bf8510fa5ce58fa5d3482e429979fd9a098c50152711dd47ab", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "55c32b7d-6a54-41c7-8172-7eae2496dba8", "text": "To achieve more diverse, equitable, and inclusive content creation, we should keep in mind the different facets of humankind.\n\nPlease check out the DE&amp;l chapter for more information."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:21e699c3-d3fb-46a2-b29e-b0a4150bd6c7", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 43, "token_count": 135, "page_number": 19, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "0b94198f-1910-4d19-806d-6268c19a2aa2", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "30ca80b985d39b7e83546abcabea0b64805b3f32aaafec4ff41174b933612c2a", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "21e699c3-d3fb-46a2-b29e-b0a4150bd6c7", "text": "To ensure real and inclusive depictions, it's essential to portray various skin tones. Each skin tone should be associated with a specific shadow number to maintain consistency. This combination offers a harmonious and unified look in the artwork.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n188,120,81 30, 55, 75,5 #BC7851 7515C 7515 U Color04 CMYK PMS-C PMS-U X3H RGB\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n248,213,202 #F8D5CA 0,20,15,0 489C 489U Color 02 CMYK PMS-C PMS-U X3H RGB\n\n252,240,237 #FCFOED 0,5,4, 0 705C 7604U Color 01 CMYK PMS-C PMS-U X3H RGB\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:d98d4aea-6608-459b-af65-04669c7ba793", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 44, "token_count": 20, "page_number": 20, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "5cbc92ec-0e0d-49af-9bc7-9f89e5c215b3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "109d9c45429038bcecdbb465247ac791999638d0586884d98a4c02726f919e48", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "d98d4aea-6608-459b-af65-04669c7ba793", "text": "-Lifeforward\n\nBrand Hub | Boehringer Ingelheim\n\nBrand elements\n\n=\n\nIllustrations"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:f996e814-6b76-469a-a821-9dc4bb3779b8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 45, "token_count": 34, "page_number": 20, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "21888215-800f-4893-9efc-d32fbefcf2d6", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "408373e7b17294344ea3fb20dda5f2545ca621250b8a3dac32a64eba07fbb164", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "chunk_id": "f996e814-6b76-469a-a821-9dc4bb3779b8", "text": "illustrations.Italso creates a nice contrast,enhancing the overall composition fora more engaging and realistic artwork.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:5444a5ba-cc71-43e7-851f-b46deea51dae", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 46, "token_count": 194, "page_number": 20, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "4329a73d-8576-4baa-b9ee-ab2c45fedf4e", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_hash": "c60601c28bda4b4573c60d60f03c64c1c7b4c