:a62403fd-a117-4b9d-9e68-653359496b6a", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 5, "token_count": 52, "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "a644629d-d570-4a07-aabf-6dfb72b23a50", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "fb6ca48010b2ac8cf5c881e9040bbd53389ccf6654ae15e39c25d694533e01bc", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "a62403fd-a117-4b9d-9e68-653359496b6a", "text": "Ourillustrationstyleadds swarmth,simplicityand emotiontoour design. Itallowsustovisualizeawide range of subjects-i includingcomplex technicalormedicaltopics-while eexpressingour brandidentity.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:f0a64d78-894a-4bb5-b3cd-c4fbb7a58cb8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 6, "token_count": 100, "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "cedc958f-32ef-42f2-b597-4cabeb0b2126", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "cb54b9659f2b9171c314920a5bc5c37af6c81f2379a11133de2f4da2bb3bdc82", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "f0a64d78-894a-4bb5-b3cd-c4fbb7a58cb8", "text": "Ourillustrationstyleisguided by ourbrand core:Unwaveringoptimism'Through simplelines and shapes, weconvey themeslikecollaboration,resilience,andinnovation.Italsohelpsusshowtheexpressionof love andaffectionbetweenhumansandanimals.\n\nWeillustratewithasenseofpositivityacrossawiderangeofsubjects,frommedical toinnovation to lifestyle.Oneway wedo thisisbyusingwarmcolorpalettesand ahandmadelookand feel."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:4237ae31-bf26-4448-8db6-39fdf0bc3150", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 7, "token_count": 94, "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "b2b6b0f8-f732-4d32-bf35-b42b1f3cc361", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "f2ef2cfd5a7b0f5d1596bcaab34e290f1468c01ad1d54838bffd9308ae113069", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "4237ae31-bf26-4448-8db6-39fdf0bc3150", "text": "Ourillustrationstyleconsistsof threedifferent levelsofdetailand complexity,eachserving a specific purposeinourcommunication.\n\nWeneveruse differentstylesofillustrationwithin the samelayout-e.g.ina singleInstagrampostorona singlepageofabrochure.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLevel01:Standalone\n\n- Low degree ofrealism\n\nQuickly sharing information\n\n- Introducing a topicor framing textelements"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:74e85020-0ca5-453d-b7d0-411dee78b11b", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 8, "token_count": 30, "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "82f4cdc7-0933-4cfb-8255-e88669a7aad3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "04ceff3d2d2c9356f020d0aec6a902de4eb689faa7243f28b24a4da578ec1d55", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "74e85020-0ca5-453d-b7d0-411dee78b11b", "text": "Ourfirstillustrationstyleiscalled Standalone.Thesesimplerillustrationsframe articles orsections,giving\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:8005921e-cc8e-4f49-a2d2-030044cfd31b", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 9, "token_count": 106, "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "de7e3bdb-cb41-48f3-a390-dff1bdc07033", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "e667f54bb5a76b35e764f7470418a2508125d6e33d9b83efd027738739f36ebd", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "8005921e-cc8e-4f49-a2d2-030044cfd31b", "text": "ForStandaloneillustrations,thegoalisto communicate a clearand straightforward message.Therefore,we useprimary colorstosimplifythe communication.Thismakesiteasier tounderstand,andenhancesbrand recognition.\n\nHead to thededicated'Color'chapterforthecorrectcolorcodes.\n\n'Accent Green'stroke\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nOn'Dark Green'backgrounds\n\nonly\n\nBlackstroke on White background\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLimiteduseon colorrestricted mediaonly"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:8a42e08a-c2f5-4262-8e17-fca492aff3e0", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 10, "token_count": 64, "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "b17d515a-df8d-403d-a818-2e546cd4e898", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "dd23458ce2322c04346b2a67c1f22cffdf766f1b9be4a79e6fb958531310f67b", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "8a42e08a-c2f5-4262-8e17-fca492aff3e0", "text": "The Standalone can beused in three differentways inside the format:\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSize and position of Standalone You can use size and position more flexiblyin Standalone.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n'Dark Green'stroke On'Light Gray'andWarm Gray\"\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:dcc4f333-e062-41ff-8b09-ed3de185bff8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 11, "token_count": 110, "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "6bfc3ce9-b9d2-42e8-8c5b-3e52603665dc", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "52a578eaefc56859748ab97d498f15b3ffbccad0dc19d545e0645a14dab5fd40", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "dcc4f333-e062-41ff-8b09-ed3de185bff8", "text": "Multiple Standalones canbe combined into a single format. SomeStandalones canbe centered oraligned with the edgesof the format.\n\nFramed Standalone\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nWe can trim theStandalone on one ormore sides aslongas the illustration is clear.It must align with the format's edges.\n\nNote: Don't create customized patterns. Only use illustrations as shown in this chapter.\n\nFormoreinformationonhow tocomposethecompletelayoutpleasegotoLayout"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:f6ba2b41-4841-411d-83c9-3ebcbe98c737", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 12, "token_count": 158, "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "a9762d88-f4b0-4f89-b0f8-ad201f1205ad", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "3c5b06315b55d9e5204d639bd2c34a316dd8df6b116490e20b754b46a8bb79be", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "f6ba2b41-4841-411d-83c9-3ebcbe98c737", "text": "TheminimumsizeofaStandaloneensures theillustrationisclearlylegibleandvisibleinallphysicaland digitalapplications. Theminimumsize iscalculated onthelongersideof theillustration.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nminimum screen size\n\nminimum print size\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n'Dark Green'stroke\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nOn'Accent Green'backgrounds\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nWhite strokeonBlack background Limited use on colorrestricted media only\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLevel02:Scene\n\n- Emotional storytelling\n- Depicting complexscenes, immersive experiences\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLevel03:Technical\n\n- Higher degree of realism\n- Technical drawings\n- Depicting medical topics\n- Informing"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:49f44366-0759-4cd9-b3fb-7f8cd9cae29c", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 13, "token_count": 5, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "48378abf-1103-4919-9a2f-61437afc20d7", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "eeb9cd65c7ee532e361a1bb8ed3deb34a080146e3b1590103b37d529efe62718", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "49f44366-0759-4cd9-b3fb-7f8cd9cae29c", "text": "Boehringer Ingelheim"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:6b067f6d-74d7-480b-ab39-4a9bd8b89cd8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 14, "token_count": 45, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "37033322-d677-4ab7-9058-36fd6f39a2eb", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "33c6553bb4e136d13c6aa537b05e46f620f7fe0012ba39482bdf9a989a861c32", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "6b067f6d-74d7-480b-ab39-4a9bd8b89cd8", "text": "Use thisillustration when you want to frame a topic.lt provides an overview and sets the context for the subjectyou'rediscussing.\n\nApp\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nBrandeditems\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:be4a27b0-9279-480c-b76e-c1bbda1d0bde", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 15, "token_count": 10, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "e4e2665b-5472-4929-bb5b-e0d126305ca2", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "b88a7b1f1e2a647702b428469d7afa1ae03df4f10746a0368cd49a52501aa8a8", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "be4a27b0-9279-480c-b76e-c1bbda1d0bde", "text": "Don'trotatethe standalone.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:b2c75ecf-6e0d-4381-867d-200b5918aa25", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 16, "token_count": 72, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "54ad74ab-7d9d-4429-92d6-abf5e3fb7deb", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "50bed29db53182f9ccd853e07784267f7e4aa47c001cf63f5cc577e41f2d6b1b", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "b2c75ecf-6e0d-4381-867d-200b5918aa25", "text": "Oursecond level,Scene,showcasesillustrationsthatareemotiveand richindetail.They'reidealfor depictingcomplexscenes and complementing associated headlines.Theseillustrations arenuancedand engage thereaderona deeperlevel,frequently appearingineditorialand digitaltouchpoints.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:c3eea999-3575-4b8f-b7f4-f7a2a56e5aed", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 17, "token_count": 247, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "55c34674-98ef-4deb-bb37-a5281e0b6300", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "57da6fad53ca027b164e404c734a092f03f8cc94498ed9bd0e85b86964c584ed", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "c3eea999-3575-4b8f-b7f4-f7a2a56e5aed", "text": "InSceneillustrations,wewant to tella storyorcreate aspecific atmosphere.Secondary colors achieve this bygiving us abroaderspectrum of hues.This then helpsus evokespecificemotions and create a playful look andfeel.\n\nWhen changing thecolor,it'sessential thatthebackground seamlesslyintegrateswith the colorsof the\n\nillustration.\n\nAsageneralrule,alwaysselect colorsthatoptimizelegibilityand create a defined contrast.We alsoneed to minimizethedifferenceinvibrancybetweencolors.\n\nHead to the dedicated'Color'chapterforthe correctcolorcodestoensureprecise colorrepresentation.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n\"Warm Gray'background\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nVioletbackground\n\nFromlighttomediumshades\n\nBluebackground Fromlight tomedium shades\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nRed background Fromlighttomediumshades\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPlease ensure thatonlyprofessionals(designers and illustrators) handle comprehensive edits to Sceneillustrations.\n\nNote: Don't use'Dark Green'or'Accent Green'asa background color for Scene illustrations."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:4cf4519e-c071-4f2d-9736-347f6020d4fc", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 18, "token_count": 71, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "5d6d9347-5199-43f1-9900-99bf9599e2a8", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "f8d4d82eb22441110708a0c54c20d35018a14d0f23ce979d89f68b6b7388d71a", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "4cf4519e-c071-4f2d-9736-347f6020d4fc", "text": "Ourillustrations aredesigned toworkacross differentformats and communicationneeds-sowe canuseit inbothfullbleedandframed.\n\nOfcourse,it'salwaysessentialthattheillustrationremainsclearand easytoidentify.\n\nThe usage ofscenei illustrations withoutbackground isnot allowed.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:cd9e83fe-c4d8-4265-b2ae-5cf2828b60a2", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 19, "token_count": 56, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "65b4e568-1a5d-4ea8-9ce3-e799c59c8e7c", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "7240fc74b4fa89c564dbebf517402436f53508d2cbb59b40f2ab03221edfb8ee", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "cd9e83fe-c4d8-4265-b2ae-5cf2828b60a2", "text": "ASceneillustrationcanbeused infullbleed forflexibilityinthelayout,ortrimmedononeormoresides while aligning with the format'sedges.If framed,makesure theillustrationis clear.\n\nScale and place the illustration\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:40b732e7-bc29-4464-8bc8-7cade9127f6a", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 20, "token_count": 34, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "cf8e30fe-8e26-4de6-89c5-1e7f4942d164", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "5b0758f7e8e4d4979fdded71194c28a581eb315024b23a369780eae4a537def6", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "40b732e7-bc29-4464-8bc8-7cade9127f6a", "text": "You canscaletheillustration and extend thebackground colortoincorporateadditionalelements.You can inserttextinthisadditionalsection,too."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:4a0f9759-6d49-48cc-a2c5-e60dadaa3a70", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 21, "token_count": 176, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "8f27b7f2-fc96-4e80-ad46-8269e1c44ed3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "b189c0053c1cc60b88dc0aac9263ab80c24c0bbbc802f5b2ca95d15109abc538", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "4a0f9759-6d49-48cc-a2c5-e60dadaa3a70", "text": "Theminimum sizeofaScene illustration ensuresclearlegibilityandvisibility acrossallphysicaland digital applications.Theminimum sizeis determinedbased on the longersideof theillustration.\n\nminimum screen size\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nminimumprint size\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nTheminimumsizefordigital screensis225pxand theminimumsizeforprintmediais60mm.\n\nExtend thebackground\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nAdd the text\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nYellowbackground From light tomedium shades\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMagazine\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPowerPoint\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon'toverlapwith text, imagesorgraphics.\n\nDon'tdistortthe standalonein any way.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon'toverlapwith otherillustrations.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:380103b2-5332-495c-a412-8311e35bd5bf", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 22, "token_count": 5, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "a5963911-09e7-4f6e-80d6-6436a83d4ec5", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "eeb9cd65c7ee532e361a1bb8ed3deb34a080146e3b1590103b37d529efe62718", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "380103b2-5332-495c-a412-8311e35bd5bf", "text": "Boehringer Ingelheim"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:8c520028-5f53-4aa9-8de2-cd73412b5a68", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 23, "token_count": 48, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "a25562c6-dd76-400c-9a4c-fbd009fe4c06", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "607216afb3f01db37d5ea6aee2a4d98ab866732984ae09325c2352038a14202c", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "8c520028-5f53-4aa9-8de2-cd73412b5a68", "text": "Use this type ofillustrationwhenyou want toframe a scene or a more specific topic.It helps thereader focusonaparticularaspectorsituation.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nNewsletter\n\nWebsite\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:02a47fa7-7d3b-4600-b880-035c3981022e", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 24, "token_count": 29, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "80199423-8aed-4ae2-aa0f-cb716e1e09f0", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "7af0d57ca4d9f582e351a8bfacb27e627bd373634c551498c130b7680e621f67", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "02a47fa7-7d3b-4600-b880-035c3981022e", "text": "Don't overlapwith text,images orgraphics.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon't create close-upsof the illustration.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:40a9c3aa-9ffd-4fa3-b1b8-efd2e292316f", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 25, "token_count": 112, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "2dcba660-e482-49cc-aeb3-ebaedfb0f1bf", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "2dba969eb8db1d50a3d5ba53dc706cb80e652f63639de0e22882d06e3cc4f881", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "40a9c3aa-9ffd-4fa3-b1b8-efd2e292316f", "text": "Ourthird level,Technical,featuresthe most detailed and precise illustrations intheset.Theseillustrations preciselyconveycomplexmedicalprocesses and technicalinformation.Weuse themineditorialmaterials andonthewebsite.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nIneachTechnicalillustration,there arethreesub-levelsofdepiction.Eachof themgivesthe audience a unique and clearperspective on themedicalprocessorissue.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nhumans oranimalstoshowcase\n\ndisease symptoms."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:faa21a10-a488-4351-870d-8e12ae31ea8b", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 26, "token_count": 214, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "85dcd5e5-5be8-42be-baa4-8d312a6f06df", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "8dfd82ccbafa6f06db2619d9e1cdb292eba218eb8560fdd45cd5c6b1e1217bf8", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "faa21a10-a488-4351-870d-8e12ae31ea8b", "text": "backgroundsand depictionsofhumansandanimals.\n\nWethenincorporatesecondary colorsto highlightand differentiatevariouselements.These colors representthings slikedifferent typesof diseases or group elements,and create distinctionswithin the illustrations.Thisensures s thatourillustrations aren't justinformative,but are alsovisually organized andeasy tounderstand.\n\nPleaserefer to thededicated'Color'chapterforthecorrectcolor codestoensureprecise color representation.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSymptom depictionsandmagnifyingtheissue\n\nUse secondary colors exclusively for'Symptom depictions'on animal fur and human clothing. Use white for all otherbodyrepresentations,whether human or animal.\n\nVarious shades of gray are used for depicting the organs,using a darker gray outline for clarity. The specific illnessarea is highlightedwithsecondary colors.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:0345a890-bfd3-4b11-a149-a9e0b648f87f", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 27, "token_count": 70, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "443c206f-5cae-4bc9-802d-0b07dcd678d7", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "02c20cf20b8938306952cc46f4f25fe25be321d0ba8dfb62d2a4ee706aee38f6", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "0345a890-bfd3-4b11-a149-a9e0b648f87f", "text": "When depicting different partsof the same organor cellularelement, usevariousshades fromthe secondarypalette.Choose edistincthueswhen differentiation isrequired.\n\nPlease ensure thatonly professionals(designers,illustrators) take careof comprehensive edits to Technicalillustrations"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:d76af101-6540-4c60-b9b9-3cf15e8b3ca7", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 28, "token_count": 97, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "c42d5fb7-a4df-4111-8b25-8e923a589c7a", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "c53384be87d1f7c2f3a11a22e10a6f830a22a9f92e65eb4e9ef6f5a1afa9b9b4", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "d76af101-6540-4c60-b9b9-3cf15e8b3ca7", "text": "Technicalillustrations support specificmedical topics.We don't crop the subjects of theseillustrations arbitrarily.However,we'vedesignedvariousformatproportionstocatertodifferentrequirements.\n\nAdditionally,you canadjustthebackground of theillustrationbycropping orextendingit.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nUsingillustrationsin different layouts\n\nCrop thebackground of theillustration\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:2a43f88e-4efc-4e5b-bdcf-a01976e682a4", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 29, "token_count": 68, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "f9953279-0613-4f72-a4e1-a61f2da19319", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "59387f166d2940aca4d10432cc1dc67817b354c99827ccf9a0e32e1c57856599", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "2a43f88e-4efc-4e5b-bdcf-a01976e682a4", "text": "Use this type ofillustration to convey specificinformation aboutmedical procedures or diseases.It's\n\neffective forpresenting health-related detailsinavisuallyengaging way.\n\nPleased don'tuse theillustrationsfor anytopic thatisunrelated to specificmedical/technical subjects."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:2179e9b9-eb80-4fea-a56b-9e942b8f1912", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 30, "token_count": 6, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "b5172a6c-7d0f-46b4-be5b-cf640902dfa7", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "2e608890ae7a1d37a68c5f07617c7c10ce84a6be18788d8e699b14ac0729b299", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "2179e9b9-eb80-4fea-a56b-9e942b8f1912", "text": "PowerPoint\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ecf89332-bb1b-498e-909e-5b79f29e8652", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 31, "token_count": 223, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "e427ddd6-bcc4-4f29-8289-7d1bbc35377f", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "8ab77f0210826152d2ac063ea566d6fa706645e11cac48cf59da9fcc704a7023", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "ecf89332-bb1b-498e-909e-5b79f29e8652", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\nDon'tuse Technical illustrationsfortopics unrelatedtothe specificmedical subjectthatthe illustrationis describing.\n\nExtend thebackground\n\nAdd the text\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMagnifying theissue Delving into thehuman or animal body tohighlightinternal medical subjects.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nCellularinsight Revealing intricate medical conceptsbyentering cellsor structurestoprovideadeeper understanding.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMagazine\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPowerPoint\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon'trotate or distortthe illustration.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nAlwaysalign the framed side with the border of the artboard.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon'toverlapwithtext orimages.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon't overlap with other illustrations.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nAlways ensure clarity when framing the illustration.\n\nDon'toverlapwith otherillustrations or icons.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon'trotateordistort the illustration.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:26a946b2-4e0c-4b4d-9d1f-4eb7be6aba92", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 32, "token_count": 5, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "0f926125-b564-4bb5-a82c-e45b5659e396", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "eeb9cd65c7ee532e361a1bb8ed3deb34a080146e3b1590103b37d529efe62718", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "26a946b2-4e0c-4b4d-9d1f-4eb7be6aba92", "text": "Boehringer Ingelheim"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ed3be807-7f27-4496-ba8e-72363b14fb63", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 33, "token_count": 83, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "df9b7a7f-24d5-4e9c-903f-3b4590eb53fe", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "5f0a95a0d6149696bc96b84093a872e0bfa46d8902b0e06e830acc79fe601aa9", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "ed3be807-7f27-4496-ba8e-72363b14fb63", "text": "When decidingwhether touseanillustration oranicon,remember:weuseillustrationsto conveyvarying degreesofdepth and complexity,evoking amoreemotionalresponse,andadding a storytellingelementto ourdesignandcontent. Weuseiconstosharesimpleinformationandprovideguidanceandnavigation-all throughasingle identifiablegraphic.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ad1af868-3e40-4b10-b0f7-75f00b4f6ba7", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 34, "token_count": 46, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "36fe8e38-6c64-46bc-a5b9-19aa414c31dc", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "c585fa42747dc46405a3babfb958f296bf4549fa643eff4bae46223dc82f42af", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "ad1af868-3e40-4b10-b0f7-75f00b4f6ba7", "text": "HowtocreatetheStandalone illustrations\n\nReadonfortipsand techniques forconstructing Standalone illustrations.Thiswill ensurewe'realladhering to the same approved style.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:c81df635-8774-49e5-8715-7ba0e1875b51", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 35, "token_count": 70, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "1e8a2eea-1104-4d95-8e27-a3344a5465b2", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "bad088f5efb486cd3d9a5570a18b2c59cb7877dea5c6f00f71d22262768c03cc", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "c81df635-8774-49e5-8715-7ba0e1875b51", "text": "Standaloneillustrationsaredesignedwithacanvassizeof2o0x200px.Thelongersideof theillustration mustmeasureprecisely2o0px,and theillustration should becentered within the frame.You canscale the illustrationwhilepreservingthesameproportionsastheoriginal2o0x2o0pxartwork.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:a38cd815-e6ba-41be-be15-7877a1ae7dbf", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 36, "token_count": 83, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "d92d983e-2262-4b6f-8028-94b9a3cf5016", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "72ac4b820ef987780bfd6ada662042f92345b29e2d74d558ea913b60d9f22043", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "a38cd815-e6ba-41be-be15-7877a1ae7dbf", "text": "Tomaintaina consistentvisualstyleand levelofdetailinourillustrations,weexcludethefullbodyofpeople orlargeranimals. Thisguideline appliestoanimalssuchascows,horses,and otherspeciessurpassing specificsizeorweight threshold,typicallymeasuring over7o cminheightattheshoulder. Humansare alwaysportraitstylewiththefaceonly.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:52354370-65f2-42c4-9a77-c5c04e8d229f", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 37, "token_count": 88, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "630ea21c-1e5f-4496-9c4a-ad02c9954cf6", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "9efd19d72f131c13081e33ccd2d02b87a734355adb776b6c3898feb012e1d8d9", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "52354370-65f2-42c4-9a77-c5c04e8d229f", "text": "Createindividualsubjectswithauniformstrokewidth.Beginwitha200x200pxartboard andsetthestroke widthto1.5pt. Toachieve ahand-drawn appearance,chooseorganicshapes overexcessively geometric ones.However,its essentialweensure thatvectorpointsaresmooth,and thefinalartworkappearsclean,devoid ofany unnaturalbumpsorirregularitiesinthestrokes.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:baeeddfc-1cbb-4d0f-a823-a2b6a91fbef8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 38, "token_count": 68, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "2300f52e-fccb-497f-936d-8c6e076c5695", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "57e7f94509dfe69bc0b382052c7a6ce2489572a0be73660750d9ed9e29d49c05", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "baeeddfc-1cbb-4d0f-a823-a2b6a91fbef8", "text": "Thestrokewidthremains at1.5ptwitha consistent widthprofile.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nStrokesetuponillustration\n\nMake sureyou configure the strokefunctionsin AdobeIllustratortomatchtheparametersoutlined intheseguidelines.\n\nDon't mix stroke widths in an illustration.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:b4324906-4a83-47ce-a494-f070e9735629", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 39, "token_count": 72, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "7cec23ed-9d82-46a7-8fa1-bdbf762e7055", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "10852d744e38f6ec5a7d70db042bcb4424734fd72e2aa5ab9adb8ddf86364266", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "b4324906-4a83-47ce-a494-f070e9735629", "text": "Somepartsof theStandalone should haveup to2filled areas.These areas shouldrepresent5-15%of the full illustrations tomaintaina goodbalancebetween outlinesand filled areas and to ensure consistency acrosstheillustrations.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nThefilled area mustnotexceed 15%oftheillustration."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:d16b55f6-43dd-4b83-accf-3c2d49992723", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 40, "token_count": 45, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "164c7cbd-6a70-4cd4-9568-6c16e0a07916", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "d88cbddc53d355878de1d505fc2904baba7c4976e62b690dda6ad7e212bbe461", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "d16b55f6-43dd-4b83-accf-3c2d49992723", "text": "Whensuitablefortheillustration,employa'crossing line'toenhanceit.Thismethod involvesincorporating anorganiclinethatintersectstheartwork,adding dynamismandengagement.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:c15dadd5-42e6-4bbe-8f06-d0c8e88bc773", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 41, "token_count": 23, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "145baaeb-8471-48de-8f21-94c58ebc3c24", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "9a4c4e80c01de081c770b50ea11b4ecea4573cd190164347f6cf2cb59a66c297", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "c15dadd5-42e6-4bbe-8f06-d0c8e88bc773", "text": "Toinfuseourillustrationswith awarmeraesthetic,depicthuman and animaleyesina morerealisticway."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:eddd2fb0-f4a8-4964-a1e1-c5fc8b9e7567", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 42, "token_count": 46, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "ff272388-af15-4254-83f6-02c8d8b2730f", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "480389d63116594958105e3d439f442a42508b7ec796a903250ec23c5d7c9ebd", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "eddd2fb0-f4a8-4964-a1e1-c5fc8b9e7567", "text": "Forhuman eyes,we emphasizedetail whenrendering theuppereyelid and eyeball.The shape of theupper eyelid mayvarybased onthesubject'scharacteristics,likeageand ethnicity.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:afa37476-f601-4a30-a583-7cd996d43e6b", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 43, "token_count": 76, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "2f902942-1cbe-4110-9370-c930fa441d08", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "450637e1d836a2dd17181a12a9a459b11bf63ac7ae7c38e39f87adcf0924f9dc", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "afa37476-f601-4a30-a583-7cd996d43e6b", "text": "Wemeticulouslydesign animaleyestocapturetheessenceofeachspecies,showingavarietyofeyeshapes androundnesswhilestrivingforarealistic,handcraftedappearance. Wedon'tuseperfectcirclesandinsteadoptforamorenatural shapethatbetterrepresentstheiractual appearance.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nColor combination\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:4a42160b-3e44-4a61-bccb-9ed21bf52371", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 44, "token_count": 18, "page_number": 9, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "de6234ae-3a52-48d3-b3b6-22e32ebbd8cb", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "f3b6158dead76c0d088f6727f12c46df6acc52519eff44a62bf55a6115d3e5f3", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "4a42160b-3e44-4a61-bccb-9ed21bf52371", "text": "Thecorners and capsof the strokesshould always\n\nhaveroundedattributes."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:d4512ebb-b151-409a-861e-f2291aa22494", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 45, "token_count": 27, "page_number": 10, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "8eafa85d-fe4f-4030-a68d-a9bc3ebc91d8", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "1e8f6f966c8c3d7b12aae948a5c9d663c2004d5159bf94254cc00b879683eb21", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "d4512ebb-b151-409a-861e-f2291aa22494", "text": "ILLUSTRATIONS DESIGN GUIDE\n\nBoehringer Ingelheim ILLUSTRATIONS DESIGN GUIDE\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:a1aecbdb-3b2b-4d0d-a968-73ed193f9bf0", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 46, "token_count": 43, "page_number": 11, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "7d000c79-d3f0-4d14-8a0f-e7085b25ad6f", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_hash": "10eec43cc43134f800c5e5169e051abbc98570ee3bfce9053193b2ff3a4f4265", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "chunk_id": "a1aecbdb-3b2b-4d0d-a968-73ed193f9bf0", "text": "Boehringer Ingelheim\n\nexpression\n\nEyesand\n\nEyesplayacentralroleinourillustrations,vital forshowinginclusivity,emotional connections,and\n\nexpressingfeelings.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:aafeaafa-fadf-4b54-b116-442834aabd9b", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 0, "token_count": 4, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "44a52bdb-8d8f-4660-8b53-c06136a18611", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "e5dc819883d3c4b39a4a3f3054652d05bbceb23ae07f1d5f396b3cb309cce5fb", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "aafeaafa-fadf-4b54-b116-442834aabd9b", "text": "<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:975d079b-0777-4bfb-a08c-1c22521456af", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 1, "token_count": 22, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "38183a09-13c3-42a5-b95d-3b6497b777cb", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "210b605d5367d09fab1d68f301f21e73545d3072d0db9b61ff32430d7f452d23", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "975d079b-0777-4bfb-a08c-1c22521456af", "text": "Guidance / Art direction\n\nFebruary, 2026\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLife forward"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:0a855a7c-b7c6-4ab3-8560-585170c249f6", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 2, "token_count": 36, "page_number": 2, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "fa98bbfc-8714-462b-b2b8-37d6de7e8182", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "a024f365858dd81b08c41157c19a1e00899f81c1f3b7558aec5fd2f902f5325f", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "0a855a7c-b7c6-4ab3-8560-585170c249f6", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:2c6b40ec-fad1-42c6-ae82-0bb4b82f3b4d", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 3, "token_count": 41, "page_number": 3, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "bb6a53d3-0d60-49e8-9c5a-ccd7e86e1be4", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "26a63444e0f0b7ace9c2ab06827bf8134ebd9d4bd6ed1e303ac1dea39cec4ea4", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "2c6b40ec-fad1-42c6-ae82-0bb4b82f3b4d", "text": "1\n\nHair should be illustrated in a simplified way, avoiding brush-like strokes. Overall, hair details should be kept to a minimum to maintain a clean visual style."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:1deb7e6b-d5a8-43c1-8e5e-ff9fbb512372", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 4, "token_count": 34, "page_number": 3, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "e5481313-a75e-4b29-abec-6109efc1c16a", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "6be1fe51c87be15ef1a781979b8a523e1d0c7b87ce1d53aec8798ce8ea8825a2", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "1deb7e6b-d5a8-43c1-8e5e-ff9fbb512372", "text": "Only one single eye shape should be used for all characters and  animals. This ensures visual coherence and prevents stylistic variation."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:19cbb5cd-4973-4018-af0e-a2aab580f6b6", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 5, "token_count": 39, "page_number": 3, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "918b7f7f-832e-4484-9d9e-9b681c7ca08f", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "a4224771d554478f74458ddc99c927c7462aed2c92a8fa224fc0b8e16bf63138", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "19cbb5cd-4973-4018-af0e-a2aab580f6b6", "text": "2\n\n3\n\nThe existing color palette is expanded with four additional gray tones and three new hair colors. This allows for greater flexibility.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:c1371c40-bbc9-4530-822c-24fc22529291", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 6, "token_count": 28, "page_number": 3, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "90feea84-ff9a-4621-89b2-c6bf012b9755", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "9893c2c190f088b675b9daac70b13e1e6aa2e8c081de439cc655e79f42e87c13", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "c1371c40-bbc9-4530-822c-24fc22529291", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:b3b0272c-7f52-4abc-a093-7211867e53b8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 7, "token_count": 34, "page_number": 4, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "4290418e-1a05-44df-99b3-443a21cf4420", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "aa64a4a1388b2907d537f48e41ef2742f96b7b5d4b031ea390d29d4ebd0b6b39", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "b3b0272c-7f52-4abc-a093-7211867e53b8", "text": "4\n\nFingernails may be included depending on the zoomlevel of the illustration. When the zoom-level is close, fingernails may be included."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:e6af90b2-7317-4a75-b715-939fbe068698", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 8, "token_count": 37, "page_number": 4, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "be23c449-f8c6-4eb8-b189-9f4af6b3e170", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "ea335af69251b93edc9d1e82639f05120a419b7640273127bf9dd1a36f974508", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "e6af90b2-7317-4a75-b715-939fbe068698", "text": "5\n\nDifferent mouth shapes are allowed, including mouths with beards. A missing upper lip or simplified black areas within the mouth are acceptable."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:b7c9b9f6-2011-4ea1-b669-d121798c45ad", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 9, "token_count": 36, "page_number": 4, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "20758b18-758e-40f1-8ed3-134d970d95ab", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "7324d7c30716e04732c830fdaa00f4ba4c7135b19f4ceb6e22f71449b18da2ef", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "b7c9b9f6-2011-4ea1-b669-d121798c45ad", "text": "The use of shadows should be kept to a minimum. Avoid skin tone shading and the grayish shadowing which is mixed with black.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n6"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:94ed0d46-01ed-499a-aea7-48de1173f50b", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 10, "token_count": 36, "page_number": 4, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "62500fba-c8f8-4782-a01f-8e77536695b9", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "a024f365858dd81b08c41157c19a1e00899f81c1f3b7558aec5fd2f902f5325f", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "94ed0d46-01ed-499a-aea7-48de1173f50b", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:08655937-ab66-4a9f-a030-31032cc86a0a", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 11, "token_count": 18, "page_number": 5, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "d998d454-2f9f-48ff-a46f-8100935bacd5", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "1e939254ab7cee04e4ade69ca51185e23f8610fba7571fa45de9289955713703", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "08655937-ab66-4a9f-a030-31032cc86a0a", "text": "Ear shading is optional and can be omitted without impacting consistency."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:fc134dcc-9ce8-4421-9639-a33fa2ff6155", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 12, "token_count": 36, "page_number": 5, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "bc0cd71a-008b-4f5b-a6b8-dc28b287e415", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "2a6b35f0716ad196eddb8ec4bcd0f03326c674e65471490edcfbc4fe5b872404", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "fc134dcc-9ce8-4421-9639-a33fa2ff6155", "text": "Nose outlines are allowed when required by perspective or pose. They should be used sparingly and only when they support clarity.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:2fae6bf9-c28d-45b2-a1e9-80a56bc886f6", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 13, "token_count": 21, "page_number": 5, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "3f791725-f6f0-4457-94f2-a09d5147472b", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "5f2d7e505f80a18ca4af4565db630a07587dd30b8a6150fca7bbde2554401049", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "2fae6bf9-c28d-45b2-a1e9-80a56bc886f6", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n7\n\n8\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:98cac488-6ec9-4a52-bf3f-f8f7431ab9fa", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 14, "token_count": 17, "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "9e62acc8-7ea7-4a3c-be1d-17f22579d765", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "36f86d3c5ba5c6d864ed3005e069ca33975f7e8e08a794f74466966af412988d", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "98cac488-6ec9-4a52-bf3f-f8f7431ab9fa", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nExemplary new version\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:d48e8a40-47ba-4af7-979c-d080eef72009", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 15, "token_count": 15, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "eded8f55-b069-4287-a352-341da30aa816", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "0a53e00be0785842b247820ee13e862169a8cb99c7ccd33f9c649bbfbb3953a3", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "d48e8a40-47ba-4af7-979c-d080eef72009", "text": "Close-up perspectives are used to highlight specific details."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:a8b724b8-082c-411e-9f5e-87ff80b874a6", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 16, "token_count": 13, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "c46a1147-d366-47dc-ac2a-0b35dd9e87ae", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "3c9aa3e05ff605ccd9517ed00741e299772f085ecefe1bc4a13521cd8692f104", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "a8b724b8-082c-411e-9f5e-87ff80b874a6", "text": "Middle-distance perspectives provide a balanced view."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:a87fe5ac-72c8-4b5c-b6fc-f9847befecc1", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 17, "token_count": 16, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "429daaf4-4c5a-40db-a375-a1a4fbfac878", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "5a31a6550548646cd83aba263df91a5c6755db577e80f026db5fd6ddf040d39b", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "a87fe5ac-72c8-4b5c-b6fc-f9847befecc1", "text": "Wide perspectives are used to depict full scenes and environments."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:8a04c22d-4384-4b88-8312-d41ced2d7060", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 18, "token_count": 17, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "b8abef7b-963c-43e1-8766-ee4be30f4c81", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "19fc8317e3ac64785b805c5f116347a19c9b114fe36fed148399c3913187950b", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "8a04c22d-4384-4b88-8312-d41ced2d7060", "text": "Animals can be illustrated front-facing or in motion.\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ac92089f-dff4-4754-96cd-110816e42d3c", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 19, "token_count": 32, "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "5dafd2b3-4767-4821-8986-cb42dfd84620", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "4fcb851ff9d09aa5a7f543ba8edfa5978e429aa2e8f9c394ccee4b9afba98ac3", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "ac92089f-dff4-4754-96cd-110816e42d3c", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:5692a7e1-f783-496c-81a5-9f495f022512", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 20, "token_count": 106, "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "4440fc92-7e76-4ce4-8ca6-0b282f573ae4", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf", "source_hash": "9c7ddc2596388166dfa94fb78d3a25f6eb64bd9d022333462b9830c99199109d", "source_document_id": "933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9", "chunk_id": "5692a7e1-f783-496c-81a5-9f495f022512", "text": "© 2026 Boehringer Ingelheim International GmbH. All rights reserved.\n\nThis presentation and its contents are property of Boehringer Ingelheim and are, inter alia, protected by copyright law. Complete or partial passing on to third parties as well as copying, reproduction, publication or any other use by third parties is not permitted.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nAI illustration generation style guidance    |     ONLY FOR INTERNAL US"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:document:ded4ae29-e5c0-417b-8c08-00855d252370", "@type": "Document", "graphScope": "brand", "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "file_name": "Introduction_-_Imagery.pdf", "source_file_name": "Introduction - Imagery.pdf", "source_