y", "page_number": 3, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "199a64ad-ad39-479a-ae69-16748add7632", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "saos pue ssod epau os us uanbat asau asn a oaqns uauos aua\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ef29bfb4-0535-4ff4-941e-2c33e1def3ab"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:94139136-46f7-4ba2-892d-2567c8969c16", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Color combination", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 3, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "94139136-46f7-4ba2-892d-2567c8969c16", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "For Standalone illustrations, the goal is to communicate a clear and straightforward message. Therefore, we use primary colors to uouosa pueq sasueuua pue puesiapun ot lasea h sayew siuoenuo au ndus Head to the dedicated Color chapter for the correct color codes.\n\nDarkGreenStandalone(default) On Accent Green backgrounds\n\nAccentGreenStandalone(default) On Dark Green backgrounds only\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDark Green Standalone\n\nOn Warm Gray, Light Gray and White\n\nDark Green Standalone On main or light Yellow\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDark Green Standalone On main or light Violet\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDark Green Standalone On main or light Red\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:39846c39-9ed5-4a03-b8ab-adf538aa9e8e"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:699d8908-854b-4cee-8ad1-d8a445a628b0", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Dark Green Standalone On main or light Blue", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 3, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "699d8908-854b-4cee-8ad1-d8a445a628b0", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:fb8e8438-a31f-45c1-a8e5-1b988eac962e", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Placement", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 4, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "fb8e8438-a31f-45c1-a8e5-1b988eac962e", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\nsoslu se  se sais aoi o auo auis a u  a clear. t must align with the format's edges. FramedStandalone\n\nSize and position of Standalone can be centered or aligned with the edges of the format. AssortedStandalone Note: Don't create customized patterns. Only use illustrations as shown in this chapter.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nFor more information on how to compose the complete layout please go to Layout.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:e8eeb980-daec-4839-8b7b-6d04a2d69aa8"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:2d965f89-92c7-49aa-966b-b335efd3a8cc", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "ClearSpace", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 4, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "2d965f89-92c7-49aa-966b-b335efd3a8cc", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "Standalones. For 'Framed Standalones' the clear space is applied to the sides that are not trimmed. The minimum clear space is When placing a Standalone on layouts or in the Assorted Standalone' placement, keep distance to the other elements or 1/4ofthesizeoftheStandalone.\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:0d3c7e0c-12cd-4d3a-bfc2-c9b4e9f1b90f"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:a276e8da-2fe6-45a8-9092-8f3f370c76c9", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 5, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "a276e8da-2fe6-45a8-9092-8f3f370c76c9", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "Minimumsize\n\nThe minimum size of a Standalone ensures the illustration is clearly legible and visible in all physical and digital applications. The minimum size is calculated on the longer side of the illustration.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nminimum screen size", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:70b156c0-1013-4495-8c62-560e904d272f"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:aa03bd78-c8db-413b-8bd7-cc2cce49c928", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Sample applications", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 5, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "aa03bd78-c8db-413b-8bd7-cc2cce49c928", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "bussnosip a,nos oaans au of axauos aut sis pue maao ue sapioid i oidot e awe on suem no uaum uoenl st asn Magazine App PowerPoint Don't overlap with other illustrations.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon'ts\n\nem sue ui auoueis au hotsip auoa\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon't rotate the standalone.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:a2093ae5-9c79-40d8-b9a3-8ef0bc311f37"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:998bb7d8-15a7-41cc-a0ae-76e9e7b1af7f", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "998bb7d8-15a7-41cc-a0ae-76e9e7b1af7f", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nDon't overlap with text,images or graphics.\n\nopasoduoo aqssnu e asse ao se saeues paoss lap i multiple singular assets.\n\nDon't combine with other ilustrations or let them touch.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLevel 02:.Scenes\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nOur second level, Scene, showcases illustrations that are emotive and rich in detail. They're ideal for depicting complex scenes Auanbant janal jadaap e uo japeal au abebua pue paouenu ae suoesnl asaui saupeay pateosse buuawadwos pue appearing in editorial and digital touchpoints.\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:dea2a6cf-79d3-4156-a15f-62fe2d2bf98f"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:223ac0f1-9fea-40f1-9cc8-ef3a8ac0d522", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Colorcombination", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "223ac0f1-9fea-40f1-9cc8-ef3a8ac0d522", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "difference in vibrancy between colors.\n\nPrimary Colors and Dark shade Secondary Colors On main or light Yellow\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPrimary Colors and Dark shade Secondary Colors On main or light Violet On main or light Red Primary Colors and Dark shade Secondary Colors On main or light Blue Primary Colors and Dark shade Secondary Colors Primary Colors and Medium shade Secondary Colors On Warm Gray and Light Gray\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n'suoensnl auaos ot spa anssuayaduoo auey (soensn pue shaubisap) sieuosssasond uo eu ansua aseld", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:feddcef6-4b44-4e19-ae95-dcf5f6fc8a60"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:78451e93-a3f2-452b-8c30-3355a237aefe", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Placement", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "78451e93-a3f2-452b-8c30-3355a237aefe", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "Our illustrations are designed to work across different formats and communication needs - so we can use it in both full bleed and framed.\n\nThe usage of scene illustrations without background is not allowed.\n\nExtend the background\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nScaleandplacetheillustration You can scale the illustration and extend the background color to incorporate additional elements. You can insert text in this additional section, too. Adding additional elements Full bleed to framed trimmed on one or more sides while aligning with the format's edges.If framed, A Scene illustration can be used in full bleed for flexibility in the layout, or make sure the illustration is clear.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:0e2b6402-695a-4ae3-9cc6-17671e11346d"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:07551257-6eaf-426c-9a22-9f4fbbe67af6", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 8, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "07551257-6eaf-426c-9a22-9f4fbbe67af6", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "-Lifeforward\n\nBrand Hub | Boehringer Ingelheim\n\nBrand elements\n\nIllustrations", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:0edd42be-1e19-47ca-b555-05194ac66da0"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:8bcb7a0a-fb75-40cd-8e1d-6760322bc9f6", "@type": "Section", "graphScope":