, "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 19, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "0afbd321-6e3a-4eb6-a299-aff696713578", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "-Lifeforward\n\nBrand Hub | Boehringer Ingelheim\n\nBrand elements\n\nIllustrations", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:fbdda57e-83ac-4fd0-b150-b891da85cd25"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:e177a21b-44c6-4c8b-8ab0-7d83341e8ae3", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Body shape and inclusivity", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 19, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "e177a21b-44c6-4c8b-8ab0-7d83341e8ae3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "exaggeratebodyparts.\n\nkey.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\ntheillustration.\n\nAbasic structure is the foundation for constructing the body, ensuring the final result maintains a sense of realism while retaining the artistic and stylistic elements of", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:6df11c44-14be-414e-b45d-0dec80687bb0"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:fc979f8a-6976-4995-b59b-26c9a315226d", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Diversity, Equity &amp; Inclusion", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 19, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "fc979f8a-6976-4995-b59b-26c9a315226d", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "To achieve more diverse, equitable, and inclusive content creation, we should keep in mind the different facets of humankind.\n\nPlease check out the DE&amp;l chapter for more information.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:55c32b7d-6a54-41c7-8172-7eae2496dba8"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:0b94198f-1910-4d19-806d-6268c19a2aa2", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Skin tones for humans", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 19, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "0b94198f-1910-4d19-806d-6268c19a2aa2", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "To ensure real and inclusive depictions, it's essential to portray various skin tones. Each skin tone should be associated with a specific shadow number to maintain consistency. This combination offers a harmonious and unified look in the artwork.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n188,120,81 30, 55, 75,5 #BC7851 7515C 7515 U Color04 CMYK PMS-C PMS-U X3H RGB\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n248,213,202 #F8D5CA 0,20,15,0 489C 489U Color 02 CMYK PMS-C PMS-U X3H RGB\n\n252,240,237 #FCFOED 0,5,4, 0 705C 7604U Color 01 CMYK PMS-C PMS-U X3H RGB\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:21e699c3-d3fb-46a2-b29e-b0a4150bd6c7"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:5cbc92ec-0e0d-49af-9bc7-9f89e5c215b3", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 20, "source_document_type": "guidance_document", "section_id": "5cbc92ec-0e0d-49af-9bc7-9f89e5c215b3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Illustrations 4.pdf", "source_document_id": "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4", "text": "-Lifeforward\n\nBrand Hub | Boehringer Ingelheim\n\nBrand elements\n\n=\n\nIllustrations", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:d98d4aea-6608-459b-af65-04669c7ba793"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:21888215-800f-4893-9efc-d32fbefcf2d6", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Shadow comb