nt brandelements. It supports our distinctive looka andreflects showwecommunicate: boldlya andconfidently,in nanaccessible way\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nNote:Ournew corporate typeface ismandatoryand replacesfore.g.the Bl Sans Opti.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nThis ls a Fesdine\n\nt ahighllght\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nAa LOGO DESIGN GUIDE\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:6edb10fa-6d1d-4b0c-98cd-ea1329f1c92e"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:a27bc13a-99a5-46ca-8939-5f427eb489f8", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 4, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "a27bc13a-99a5-46ca-8939-5f427eb489f8", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\nCotoceectlos ICON DESIGN GUIDE", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:1b213580-10ee-4b51-b66a-82347735b744"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:caaa9519-351e-40cc-98ba-1dbc84c1dba3", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 5, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "caaa9519-351e-40cc-98ba-1dbc84c1dba3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "text": "Boehringer Ingelheim\n\nlcon5\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:38d6445f-ada3-48f5-bd59-d54154721c00"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:0e1e6139-7483-46cd-b332-80ee28b32498", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "ILLUSTRATIONS DESIGN GUIDE", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "0e1e6139-7483-46cd-b332-80ee28b32498", "extraction_method": "docling", "source