le": "Levelofdetail", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "b2b6b0f8-f732-4d32-bf35-b42b1f3cc361", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "text": "Ourillustrationstyleconsistsof threedifferent levelsofdetailand complexity,eachserving a specific purposeinourcommunication.\n\nWeneveruse differentstylesofillustrationwithin the samelayout-e.g.ina singleInstagrampostorona singlepageofabrochure.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLevel01:Standalone\n\n- Low degree ofrealism\n\nQuickly sharing information\n\n- Introducing a topicor framing textelements", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:4237ae31-bf26-4448-8db6-39fdf0bc3150"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:82f4cdc7-0933-4cfb-8255-e88669a7aad3", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Level01:Standalone", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "82f4cdc7-0933-4cfb-8255-e88669a7aad3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "text": "Ourfirstillustrationstyleiscalled Standalone.Thesesimplerillustrationsframe articles orsections,giving\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:74e85020-0ca5-453d-b7d0-411dee78b11b"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:de7e3bdb-cb41-48f3-a390-dff1bdc07033", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Colorcombination", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "de7e3bdb-cb41-48f3-a390-dff1bdc07033", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "text": "ForStandaloneillustrations,thegoalisto communicate a clearand straightforward message.Therefore,we useprimary colorstosimplifythe communication.Thismakesiteasier tounderstand,andenhancesbrand recognition.\n\nHead to thededicated'Color'chapterforthecorrectcolorcodes.\n\n'Accent Green'stroke\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nOn'Dark Green'backgrounds\n\nonly\n\nBlackstroke on White background\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLimiteduseon colorrestricted mediaonly", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:8005921e-cc8e-4f49-a2d2-030044cfd31b"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:b17d515a-df8d-403d-a818-2e546cd4e898", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Placement", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "b17d515a-df8d-403d-a818-2e546cd4e898", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "text": "The Standalone can beused in three differentways inside the format:\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSize and position of Standalone You can use size and position more flexiblyin Standalone.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n'Dark Green'stroke On'Light Gray'andWarm Gray\"\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:8a42e08a-c2f5-4262-8e17-fca492aff3e0"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:6bfc3ce9-b9d2-42e8-8c5b-3e52603665dc", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Assorted Standalone", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "6bfc3ce9-b9d2-42e8-8c5b-3e52603665dc", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "text": "Multiple Standalones canbe combined into a single format. SomeStandalones canbe centered oraligned with the edgesof the format.\n\nFramed Standalone\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nWe can trim theStandalone on one ormore sides aslongas the illustration is clear.It must align with the format's edges.\n\nNote: Don't create customized patterns. Only use illustrations as shown in this chapter.\n\nFormoreinformationonhow tocomposethecompletelayoutpleasegotoLayout", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:dcc4f333-e062-41ff-8b09-ed3de185bff8"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:a9762d88-f4b0-4f89-b0f8-ad201f1205ad", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Minimumsize", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 6, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "a9762d88-f4b0-4f89-b0f8-ad201f1205ad", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-b21d-44c3-883b-299017d57793", "text": "TheminimumsizeofaStandaloneensures theillustrationisclearlylegibleandvisibleinallphysicaland digitalapplications. Theminimumsize iscalculated onthelongersideof theillustration.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nminimum screen size\n\nminimum print size\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n'Dark Green'stroke\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nOn'Accent Green'backgrounds\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nWhite strokeonBlack background Limited use on colorrestricted media only\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLevel02:Scene\n\n- Emotional storytelling\n- Depicting complexscenes, immersive experiences\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLevel03:Technical\n\n- Higher degree of realism\n- Technical drawings\n- Depicting medical topics\n- Informing", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:f6ba2b41-4841-411d-83c9-3ebcbe98c737"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:48378abf-1103-4919-9a2f-61437afc20d7", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "ILLUSTRATIONS DESIGN GUIDE", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 7, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "48378abf-1103-4919-9a2f-61437afc20d7", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf", "source_document_id": "3a3871a8-